{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2022-01-28 12:15:00', 'title': 'LILLY ANNOUNCES $1 BILLION INVESTMENT IN NEW MANUFACTURING FACILITY IN NORTH CAROLINA', 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, JAN. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) PLANS TO INVEST OVER $1 BILLION TO CREATE A NEW MANUFACTURING SITE, ALONG WITH NEARLY 600 NEW JOBS IN CONCORD, NORTH CAROLINA. THE BRAND-NEW FACILITY WILL UTILIZE THE LATEST TECHNOLOGY TO MANUFACTURE PARENTERAL (INJECTABLE) PRODUCTS AND DEVICES AND INCREASE THE COMPANY'S MANUFACTURING CAPACITY."}